bWHbb8KXqit_sp1X0v9pnRfvCVh0iPAlwJ_KCqSGmw&oe=6AF1E022"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Avenpulse: VR Fitness & Flow", "keywords": ["fitness", "boxing", "mobility", "yoga", "breathing"], "long_description": "Find your daily mix of energy, movement and calm. Avenpulse brings rhythm play and guided exercise into relaxing virtual retreats.\n\nPUNCH TO THE MUSIC\nUse both hands to strike colour-matched targets in Pulse Rally. Choose a music track and learn combinations, small shifts and knee dips in untimed practice.\n\nFOLLOW YOUR COACH\nExplore standing cardio, leg practice, seated movement, desk resets and yoga-inspired flows. Watch demonstrations, hear spoken instructions, repeat a cue and switch the viewing angle. Select a smaller coach range or a slower pace.\n\nBUILD YOUR ROUTINE\nStart a four-week beginner programme, choose a daily mix or put sessions in your own queue. Review movement, mobility and quiet time in your weekly activity journal.\n\nMAKE IT YOURS\nChoose seated or standing activities, a coach voice and appearance, hand equipment, music and scenery. Adjust comfortable reach, move the menu and recenter your view.\n\nTAKE A QUIET BREAK\nSlow down with guided breathing and calm surroundings between active sessions.\n\nFor general fitness and wellbeing, not medical treatment. No account is needed inside the app. Use two Quest controllers, a clear real play area and the Quest boundary. Seated following needs a stable real chair; virtual furniture is demonstration scenery. Feet and exercise form are not tracked or scored.", "short_description": "Punch to music, follow guided standing or seated workouts, explore yoga-inspired mobility and take a breathing break. Choose your pace, comfortable reach, coach and scenery. Build a routine with a four-week beginner programme and an activity journal."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://raheelswati.github.io/avenpulse-privacy.html", "devel